  "body_markdown": "About us\n\nmeet Dr. ChrisMeet The TeamLivewell DifferenceOffice TourTechnologyJoin Our Team\n\nservices\n\ndCOEFull Mouth ReconstructionSedation Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nSmile MakeoverPorcelain VeneersNo Prep VeneersGum RecontouringTeeth WhiteningDental Bonding\n\nImplant Dentistry\n\nDental ImplantsSingle ImplantsImplant BridgesAll-on-X ImplantsLocator-Retained Dentures\n\nRestorative Dentistry\n\nDental CrownsInlays & OnlaysDental BridgesTooth-Colored Fillings\n\nOral Surgery\n\nBone GraftingRidge AugmentationTooth ExtractionSinus LiftWisdom Teeth Removal\n\nOrthodontics\n\nInvisalignBraces\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPreventive DentistryPreventive CleaningGum TherapyRoot Canal Therapy\n\nTMJ TreatmentDental Emergencies\n\nnew patient\n\nfirst visit & new examInsurance & FinancingBlog\n\nOur work\n\nSmile GalleryTestimonials\n\nContact\n\ncall (703) 690-0102Request An Appointment\n\nBook Now\n\n703-690-0102\n\nLivewell Difference\n\nmeet Dr. Chris\n\nMeet The Team\n\nJoin Our Team\n\nOffice Tour\n\nTechnology\n\nServices\n\nFull Mouth Reconstruction\n\nDCOE\n\nTMJ Treatment\n\nDental Emergencies\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nPreventive\n\nDental Bridges\n\nRoot Canal\n\nProfessional Dental Cleaning\n\nScaling & Root Planing\n\nAll General Dentistry services\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nNo Prep Veneers\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nGum Recontouring\n\nAll Cosmetic Dentistry Services\n\nSingle Implants\n\nImplant Bridges\n\nAll-on-X Implants\n\nLocator-Retained Dentures\n\nAll Implant Dentistry Services\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\nTooth Extraction\n\nSinus Lift\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nInvisalign\n\nBraces\n\nAll Orthodontics Services\n\nDental Crowns\n\nTooth-Colored Fillings\n\nDental Bonding\n\nInlays & Onlays\n\nAll Restorative Dentistry Services\n\nNew Patient\n\nfirst visit & new exam\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nBlog\n\nTestimonials\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nCALL US: (703) 690-0102\n\nBOOK AN APPOINTMENT\n\n\n# The Dentist Who Asks,“But Why?”\n\n\nBecause better dentistry starts with better questions.\n\nSmiles Made to Connect\n\nOne Doctor, Every Visit\n\nTrusted Dental Educator\n\n\n## THE QUESTIONS OTHERS OVERLOOKED\n\n\nWhile Most Dentists Focus on \"What's Broken?\" Dr. Chris Kept Asking \"What's the Root Cause?\"\n\nDuring his time at UCSF dental school, he began to see something troubling. Patient after patient returned with the same recurring problems, including new cavities, replacement crowns, and ongoing gum treatments. It was a cycle that never seemed to end.\n\nBut the deeper questions went unanswered:\n\nWhat triggered this in the first place?\n\nCould it have been prevented?\n\nHow do we break the cycle for good?\n\nThose unanswered questions stayed with him long after graduation. That's when the realization hit. Treating symptoms wasn't enough. He wanted to get to the source.\n\n\n## THE ART OF DOING IT RIGHT\n\n\nDeliberate, Patient, Refreshingly Thorough\n\nNothing is rushed here. Not the way Dr. Chris listens, plans, or builds your trust. First visits often stretch beyond an hour without a single instrument being picked up. The point isn't to jump into treatment. The point is to truly understand:\n\nWhat brought you in\n\nWhat's been overlooked\n\nWhat's standing between you and better health\n\nLivewell Dental was founded on a simple belief: take the time, do it once, do it right.\n\n\"Some patients come in convinced they need a crown. What they actually need is someone willing to slow down and ask the right questions.\"\n\nlivewell difference\n\nWatch Now\n\n\n### Dr. Chris\n\n\nTraining That Shows Up in the Care You Receive\n\nGraduate, Kois Center\n\nOne of dentistry’s most respected postdoctoral programs, focused on diagnosis, bite function, risk assessment, and comprehensive treatment planning.\n\nClinical Instructor, Implant Accelerator\n\nDr. Chris teaches other dentists advanced implant dentistry, including surgical planning, restorative design, and complex case execution.\n\nAdvanced Dental Educator\n\nDr. Chris teaches cosmetic dentistry, reconstructive dentistry, and office systems that help dentists create consistent, repeatable excellence.\n\nFellow, Academy of General Dentistry (FAGD)\n\n‍A distinction earned by fewer than 6% of general dentists, recognizing a deep commitment to advanced continuing education.\n\nFellow, International Congress of Oral Implantology (FICOI)\n\nAn international distinction in implant dentistry, recognizing advanced training, experience, and commitment to implant care.\n\nGraduate, UCSF School of Dentistry\n\nTrained at one of the most respected dental schools in the country, with a foundation in science, precision, and clinical excellence. in thoughtful, evidence-based care.\n\n\n## See what our patients have to say.\n\n\nWe Believe Trust Comes From What Patients Experience, Not What We Say About Ourselves\n\nSTORIES OF THE LIVES WE’VE TOUCHED\n\n\n## Clinical Instructor ADVANCED DENTAL EDUCATOR.\n\n\nAs a Clinical Instructor at Implant Accelerator, Dr. Chris teaches dentists the clinical execution behind advanced implant care. He also teaches cosmetic dentistry, reconstructive dentistry, documentation, and office systems that help make excellent dentistry more repeatable. For patients, that same discipline shows up in the details: precise planning, careful technique, and treatment built with the future in mind.\n\n\n## Excellence That Speaks for Itself\n\n\nWhat respected colleagues say about Dr. Chris and his care\n\n“Dr. Chris is one of the most exceptional and highly educated professionals I’ve had the privilege to know. Having worked alongside him, I’ve witnessed his attention to detail firsthand. He is truly one of a kind, and his patients are fortunate to have a dentist so committed to staying at the top of his field and delivering the best possible care. Dr. Chris, your patients are incredibly lucky to have you.”\n\n– Dr. Katie Allen\n\n@chriskim.dds you are one of the most talented, passionate, and excellent dentists I have ever had the privilege of treating mutual patients with. If anyone in my family needs high quality dental care, I’m calling you. Keep doing what you do to advance the profession and treating your patients with the highest standards.”\n\n– Dr. Justin Hughes, Orthodontist\n\n@Implant.accelerator – Dr. Chris is dedicated to life-long learning and has a genuine heart for sharing his knowledge and skills with his patients as well as his colleagues. Dr. Chris serves as a clinical instructor for Implant Accelerator, a continuing education institution for dentists. His level of understanding in oral health is top 1% in the country. We are all so lucky to have him serve our patients and colleagues\n\n– Dr. John Ku, W Plus Dental\n\n“Dr. Chris is one of the most devoted dentists I know. His patients are lucky to have him. He is one of my go-to colleagues to run cases by when I’m looking for another opinion. The passion he has for our profession inspires me to do better in my own practice.”\n\n— Dr. Curtis Henderson\n\n\n## The Person Behind the Care\n\n\nBefore Dr. Chris is a dentist, he is a husband, a father, and someone who understands how much the little moments matter. Life with Sara and their son Ollie has made him even more aware that people do not just want excellent dentistry. They want to feel safe, understood, and cared for by someone who is fully present.\n\nOutside the office, you may find him making pasta at home, enjoying coffee, skiing, training, or looking at the world through a camera lens. Those parts of his life keep him grounded. They remind him to slow down, notice the details, and treat each person with the same care he hopes his own family would receive.\n\n\n### Reimagine your dental experience\n\n\n\n### address\n\n\n9027 Silverbrook Rd Ste. F\n\nFairfax Station, VA 22039\n\n\n### Contact\n\n\n\n### Hours\n\n\nMon-Tue: 8am-5pm\n\nWed-Thu: 8am-4pm\n\nFri: 8am-1pm\n\n\n### Connect\n\n\nServing Fairfax Station and the Greater Northern Virginia Area\n\nCopyright © TEXT-YEAR Livewell Dental\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms of Service\n\nCookie Policy\n\nHIPAA Disclosure\n\nConsent Preferences",
